  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BlendMode.Showcase::BlendMode.Showcase.S14_HazeStation
  title: Haze and light shafts
  caption: Pale haze drawn with Screen sits in front of the far hills, so they turn
    lighter and flatter, like real distance. Warm beams drawn with Soft light then
    brighten the scene in stripes without washing it out.
  formula: 'Haze: Screen 1 - (1 - b)(1 - s), Fixed-function.  Beams: Soft light,
    Compositor (it needs the backdrop).'
