  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BlendMode.Showcase::BlendMode.Showcase.S11_DesaturateStation
  title: Desaturate on damage
  caption: Saturation takes how vivid the top layer is and gives it to the picture
    below, keeping its colors and brightness. The top layer is plain gray, so as
    health drops the world drains toward black and white.
  formula: 'Saturation: SetLum(SetSat(b, Sat(s)), Lum(b)), with s = gray. Pause adds
    Multiply to dim. Compositor.'
  blendOn: 1
  opacity: 1
  statusLabel: {fileID: 87365944}
  fixedShader: {fileID: 4800000, guid: 6abab2704f20cb34aa40c3ccf6589f22, type: 3}
