  m_text: '<b>Left / Right</b> or <b>A / D</b> move   <b>Space</b> Blend on / off  
    <b>F</b> hit (station 6)

    <size=88%><b>b</b> = the picture underneath, <b>s</b>
    = the layer being blended on top.

    <b>Fixed-function</b>: the graphics card
    blends while drawing (fast, 9 modes).

    <b>Compositor</b>: layers are blended
    into a picture first, like Photoshop (all 27).</size>'
