  m_text: <b>How it works:</b> Both bars subtract colors from what is under them,
    so bright areas flip to dark and dark ones light up. Difference gives pure black
    where the two match. Exclusion is a softer, grayer version of the same idea.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
