  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BlendMode.Showcase::BlendMode.Showcase.S13_TilemapStation
  title: 'Tilemap: baked shadows and variation'
  caption: Shadows are their own tile layer drawn with Multiply, so they darken any
    tile underneath. A big soft noise layer then goes on top with Overlay, so repeated
    grass tiles stop looking identical.
  formula: 'Shadow layer: Multiply b x s, Fixed-function on the TilemapRenderer. 
    Variation: Overlay, Compositor over a camera RenderTexture.'
  blendOn: 1
  opacity: 1
  statusLabel: {fileID: 11879514}
  fixedShader: {fileID: 4800000, guid: 6abab2704f20cb34aa40c3ccf6589f22, type: 3}
