  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BlendMode.Showcase::BlendMode.Showcase.S04_DayNightStation
  title: Day to night
  caption: A camera films the village, then two color layers go on top. Multiply
    with deep blue darkens it, and Soft light with orange or blue tints it like a
    gentle lamp. Drag the slider to change the time.
  formula: 'Multiply: b x s.  Soft light: gentle contrast toward s (W3C curve). Compositor
    over a camera RenderTexture.'
  blendOn: 1
  opacity: 1
