  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BlendMode.Showcase::BlendMode.Showcase.S15_WaterStation
  title: Water shimmer
  caption: Two ripple textures slide over the pond in different directions. They
    are mostly 50% gray, which Soft light ignores, so only their bright lines show,
    as moving glints. They are clipped to the pond so the grass stays still.
  formula: Soft light with a scrolling texture (per-layer UV offset), clipped to
    the water. Compositor.
  blendOn: 1
  opacity: 1
