  title: 'Particles: Normal vs Add'
  caption: The same fire twice. With Normal, each particle covers the ones behind
    it. With Add, overlapping particles add their light together, so the core of
    the fire glows hot.
  formula: 'Linear dodge (Add): b + s.  Left side Normal, right side Add. Fixed-function.'
